    'Validasi data & instrumentasi': 'Data & instrumentation checks', 'Memeriksa apakah penurunan nyata, bukan artefak pelacakan': 'Checks whether the drop is real, not a tracking artefact',
    'Analisis funnel': 'Funnel analysis', 'Memecah proses per langkah dan menemukan titik drop-off': 'Breaks the process into steps and finds the drop-off point',
    'Segmentasi & pembanding': 'Segmentation & comparison', 'Perangkat, kanal, periode pembanding': 'Device, channel, comparison period',
    'Rekomendasi tindak lanjut': 'Follow-up recommendation', 'Usulan eksperimen dan metrik keberhasilan': 'Proposed experiment and success metrics',
    'Semua ujian · 14 menunggu': 'All exams · 14 pending', 'Soal 10 · Essay': 'Question 10 · Essay', 'Tugas 2 · Unggah berkas': 'Task 2 · File upload', 'Soal 28 · Short answer': 'Question 28 · Short answer',
    'Langkah pertama saya memastikan penurunan itu nyata, bukan karena perubahan pelacakan. Saya bandingkan jumlah event checkout_started dan purchase sebelum dan sesudah rilis, lalu cek apakah tag analitik ikut berubah.': 'First, I would confirm the drop is real and not caused by a tracking change. I would compare checkout_started and purchase event counts before and after the release, then check whether the analytics tags changed too.',
    'Kedua, saya pecah funnel checkout per langkah (keranjang → alamat → pengiriman → pembayaran → konfirmasi) untuk melihat di langkah mana drop-off bertambah. Data yang dibutuhkan: log event per sesi, jenis perangkat, browser, metode pembayaran, dan waktu muat halaman.': 'Second, I would break the checkout funnel into steps (cart → address → shipping → payment → confirmation) to see where drop-off increased. Data needed: per-session event logs, device type, browser, payment method, and page load time.',
    'Ketiga, saya segmentasi per perangkat dan metode pembayaran. Jika penurunan hanya terjadi di mobile, kemungkinan ada masalah tampilan. Saya juga bandingkan dengan periode yang sama minggu lalu untuk menghilangkan efek musiman.': 'Third, I would segment by device and payment method. If the drop only happens on mobile, there is probably a layout problem. I would also compare against the same period last week to rule out seasonality.',
    'Terakhir, saya rekomendasikan A/B test antara versi lama dan baru dengan metrik utama conversion rate dan metrik pendukung average order value serta error rate formulir.': 'Finally, I would recommend an A/B test between the old and new versions, with conversion rate as the primary metric and average order value and form error rate as supporting metrics.',
    'Saya akan melihat Google Analytics untuk mengetahui halaman mana yang paling banyak ditinggalkan, kemudian bertanya kepada tim developer apa yang berubah. Setelah itu saya membuat laporan.': 'I would look at Google Analytics to see which page is abandoned most, then ask the developers what changed. After that I would write a report.',
